; Self-test capture: samples one input pin every clock cycle.
; Configure: IN base = S/PDIF pin, shift left (earliest sample in bit 31),
; autopush at 32, joined RX FIFO. The pin is only read, never claimed: it
; stays with the transmitter's PIO, and every PIO block sees every pad input.

.program selftest_capture
.wrap_target
    in pins, 1
.wrap
